<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">HR Intelligence & Workforce Analytics</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Transform high-volume personnel data into strategic organizational guidance, identifying 
            long-term trends and providing an empirical basis for talent strategy.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Demographics & Structural Transparency</h2>
        <p>
            Experience radical transparency into your organization's composition. Analyze 
            gender diversity, age distribution, and seniority profiles across all 
            departments. These deep demographics provide the data required to track 
            progress against organizational diversity goals and identify potential 
            imbalances that may impact cultural resilience or succession planning 
            longevity.
        </p>
        <p>
            Tenure analytics identify 'high-risk' periods during the employee lifecycle where 
            attrition is most likely, enabling HR to target engagement interventions 
            more effectively.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Recruitment Velocity & Effectiveness</h2>
        <p>
            Evaluate your talent acquisition effectiveness with high-fidelity operational metrics. 
            Analyze 'Time-to-Hire' and 'Offer Acceptance Rates' across different managers 
            and product lines. Correlating recruitment sourcing data with subsequent 
            employee performance ratings identifies the most effective hiring channels, 
            allowing for the target deployment of recruitment budgets toward 
            high-yield sourcing strategies.
        </p>
        <p>
            Turnover reason-code analysis—derived from exit interviews—highlights 
            recurrent structural or management issues, providing leadership with 
            the insight needed to improve organizational retention.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Financial & Liability Reporting</h2>
        <p>
            Quantify the fiscal health of your human capital ecosystem. The system generates 
            authoritative reports on Leave Liability valuations and provides year-on-year 
            payroll variance analysis, identifying the drivers of total labor cost 
            growth. Correlating training expenditure with individual performance rating 
            shifts provides an empirical view of organizational learning impact, 
            facilitating data-driven strategic planning for the next fiscal year.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

